sequenceDiagram
accTitle: SMTP encryption precedes authentication
accDescr: The unchanged SMTP client upgrades its connection with STARTTLS, then authenticates using regional SES SMTP credentials before sending mail.
participant App as EC2 mail client
participant SES as Regional SES SMTP
App->>SES: Connect on TCP 587 and EHLO
SES-->>App: STARTTLS available
App->>SES: STARTTLS
SES-->>App: TLS established
App->>SES: AUTH with SES SMTP credentials
SES-->>App: Authenticated
App->>SES: Submit message
